&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://jerseycity.njit.edu/aritra-dasgupta" target="_blank"&gt;Aritra Dasgupta&lt;/a&gt;, Associate Professor of Data Science at the New Jersey Institute of Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anthony Diaz, Director of the Newark Water Coalition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://people.njit.edu/profile/maher" target="_blank"&gt;Neil Maher&lt;/a&gt;, Professor of History at the New Jersey Institute of Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
